// The sum bus of sum_bus.pil (plan M30) with the std's MAX_CONSTRAINT_DEGREE raised to 4: both
// terms fit in one fraction of denominator degree 2 (std_sum.pil, piop_gsum_air), and gsum_col alone
// gives the stage-2 column `gsum`, from the columns of stage 1, with no im_col (plan M31). The same
// AIR, witness (tests/data/sum_bus.rs) and compilation as sum_bus.pil's.
//
// The degree is set before sum_bus.pil is read: the std reads it when it closes the AIR's bus, and
// requires std_constants.pil only once.
require "std_constants.pil"

set_max_constraint_degree(4);

require "sum_bus.pil"
